{"t":"Gingerbread Key","s":"gingerbread-key-949e1","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Gingerbread_Key_fc152a.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Gingerbread Key</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Gingerbread Key\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gingerbread_Key_fc152a.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Other Items<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a><br/>Decorations</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.40 oz</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">13.40.54ea79<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 01, 2024<br/>Summer Update 2024</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20240604143931&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gingerbread_Key_fc152a.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a gingerbread key.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.40 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Gingerbread Key</strong> is used in the <a href=\"#/quest/threatened-dreams-quest\">Threatened Dreams Quest - Sweet Dreams</a> and undergoes several transformations with different sirups. These transformations are as follows:\n</p>\n<ul><li>First Stage: Using a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Moon%20Melon%20Sirup\">Flask with Moon Melon Sirup</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Moon%20Melon%20Sirup\"><img alt=\"Flask with Moon Melon Sirup\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flask_with_Moon_Melon_Sirup_a285bb.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> on the <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Gingerbread Key</strong> will change it to a Gingerbread Key with Moon Melon. <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Gingerbread Key (Moon Melon)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gingerbread_Key_Moon_Melon_4ee336.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></li></ul>\n<ul><li>Second Stage: Using a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Raspberry%20Sirup\">Flask with Raspberry Sirup</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Raspberry%20Sirup\"><img alt=\"Flask with Raspberry Sirup\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flask_with_Raspberry_Sirup_1fe673.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> on the Gingerbread Key (Moon Melon) will change it to a Gingerbread Key with Moon Melon and Raspberry. <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Gingerbread Key (Moon Melon and Raspberry)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gingerbread_Key_Moon_Melon_and_Raspberry_0bf044.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></li></ul>\n<ul><li>Final Stage: Using a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Lemon%20Sirup\">Flask with Lemon Sirup</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Lemon%20Sirup\"><img alt=\"Flask with Lemon Sirup\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flask_with_Lemon_Sirup_ee8ccd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> on the Gingerbread Key (Moon Melon and Raspberry) will change it to a <a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Key%20%28Moon%20Melon%2C%20Raspberry%20and%20Lemon%29\">Gingerbread Key with Moon Melon, Raspberry, and Lemon</a>. <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Key%20%28Moon%20Melon%2C%20Raspberry%20and%20Lemon%29\"><img alt=\"Gingerbread Key (Moon Melon, Raspberry and Lemon)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gingerbread_Key_Moon_Melon_Raspberry_and_Lemon_8e2aaf.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<p>To create these sirups, you must combine <a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20%28Quest%29\">Sugar</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20%28Quest%29\"><img alt=\"Sugar (Quest)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sugar_Quest_9c6d9d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Moon%20Melon\">Moon Melon</a>, <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Moon%20Melon\"><img alt=\"Moon Melon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Moon_Melon_518179.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> a <a href=\"#/wiki/Raspberry\">Raspberry</a>, <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Raspberry\"><img alt=\"Raspberry\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Raspberry_7b03f3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Lemon\">Lemon</a>, <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lemon\"><img alt=\"Lemon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lemon_8f1a93.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> respectively. This will yield a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Moon%20Melon%20Sirup\">Flask with Moon Melon Sirup</a>, <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Moon%20Melon%20Sirup\"><img alt=\"Flask with Moon Melon Sirup\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flask_with_Moon_Melon_Sirup_a285bb.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Raspberry%20Sirup\">Flask with Raspberry Sirup</a>, <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Raspberry%20Sirup\"><img alt=\"Flask with Raspberry Sirup\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flask_with_Raspberry_Sirup_1fe673.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Lemon%20Sirup\">Flask with Lemon Sirup</a>, <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Lemon%20Sirup\"><img alt=\"Flask with Lemon Sirup\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flask_with_Lemon_Sirup_ee8ccd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> which are used on the key in that specific order.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Lemon%20Sirup\">Flask with Lemon Sirup</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Moon%20Melon%20Sirup\">Flask with Moon Melon Sirup</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Raspberry%20Sirup\">Flask with Raspberry Sirup</a></li><li>Gingerbread Key (Moon Melon and Raspberry)</li><li>Gingerbread Key (Moon Melon)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Key%20%28Moon%20Melon%2C%20Raspberry%20and%20Lemon%29\">Gingerbread Key (Moon Melon, Raspberry and Lemon)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lemon\">Lemon</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Chocolate%20Dough\">Lump of Chocolate Dough</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Moon%20Melon\">Moon Melon</a></li><li>Oven (Feyrist)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Raspberry\">Raspberry</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20%28Quest%29\">Sugar (Quest)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/threatened-dreams-quest\">Threatened Dreams Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["threatened-dreams-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"threatened-dreams-quest","quest":"Threatened Dreams Quest","step":"7-1","n":66,"title":"Perguntar à Maelyrra pelo donut","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33484,"y":32237,"z":7,"label":"Maelyrra"}]}]}}